 www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\",\"uploadDate\":\"2014-05-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Viva Cinema Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>In Bahrain you can now  skip the long queues at the cinema when you buy tickets online using VIVA Cinema website. Nice to voice for these guys.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Voicing this explainer video for Viva Cinema, Bahrain</h2>\r\n<p>I do a surprising amount of work for companies based in the Middle East, such as this explainer for Viva Cinema and the work I did for Dubai Advantage. English is used as the lingua franca for so many countries around the World, which means that English voiceover artists like me can get a lot of work if they have a nice website and are easy to work with... I really liked working on this explainer video for Viva Cinema and I think it turned out really nicely. Explainers are becoming the main type of video I work on and I can see why. if you'd like a few more examples of them, check out my <a href=\"/eze-group-explainer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Eze Group\">Eze Group</a> and <a href=\"/batelco-wifi-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Batelco Explainer\">Batelco</a> (another company in Bahrain!) explainer videos. "}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/E4IlxYsd90s","title":"Viva Cinema Voiceover","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/viva-cinema-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Viva Cinema Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A little more about Viva Cinema</h2>\r\n<p>Viva Cinema is Bahrain's leading cinema company, with six different cinemas scattered around the country. Viva Bahrain has done a lot to make sure their customers have access to all of the last films from around the World. They have also introduced the skip-the-line online feature I'm describing in this explainer video. I think Viva Cinema is getting its branding and advertising just right and I'm very pleased that my voiceover is being used in their ads. I'd love to work with them again.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Are you looking for this voice style for your next <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>? Please get in touch. I'd be very happy to send a short sample of your script to you before you book me. Please send a few lines of the script first so you can be sure I'm right for your brand. I make the whole process as easy as possible with 99% of the jobs delivered the same day.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Viva Cinema Voiceover","pageUrl":"viva-cinema-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","631",{"href":"/sage-one-accounting","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","di